Z||000003||fropuff||01-15-2001||09:36 PM||||You can find it other places.  I think NOS sells the kit directly for $499.  That's the one I'm going to get.  If you go on <A HREF="http://www.jegs.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jegs.com</A>  and do a keywork search for nitrous, there's a part #113-13080; it's a 50/75/100 HP adjustable shot.  It goes for $439.99.<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.||||reg||1
